    "en": "The Legal Move"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "五个朋友住进两间三张床的屋子，一次只搬一个人，两屋人数最多差 1。Ada、Eva 能省最多却不许动；Dev 可以，然后 Ada 才可以；亏的也试，回退到最佳前缀；另外六个人身上，两步小亏换来 +4；最后空前缀让一切停下。",
    "en": "Five friends in two rooms of three beds, moving one at a time, the rooms differing by one at most. Ada and Eva would save the most but may not move; Dev may, and then Ada can; the losses are tried too, and it rolls back to the best prefix; with six other people, two small losses buy a gain of 4; and the empty prefix ends it."
   },
